<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1078862/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078863" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center"> Viro <choice><abbr>Praeclariss.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Praeclarissimo</expan></choice> et toto Orbe Celeberrimo
      <lb/>Johanni <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoulli</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/>Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>Iucundissimas <rs key="B_991170515017505501" type="letter">tuas litteras</rs> 4<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice><hi rend="sup">ta</hi> die huius mensis
      <lb/>ad me datas magna cum L<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>titia accepi. Et quod
      <lb/>de mea acquisita valetudine mihi gratula<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tus fueris gratias ago maximas. Vocatio so<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lemnis <choice><abbr>Celeberr.</abbr><expan>Celeberrimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person"><choice><sic>Agni</sic><corr>Agnati</corr></choice> Tui</rs> propediem (ut spe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ro) ad vos perveniet, iamque pervenisset
      <lb/>nisi Turcarum approximatio ad <rs key="place_WEI-korfua" type="place"><choice><orig>Jnsulam</orig><reg>Insulam</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/>(qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> dicitur Corfù) magno cum exercitu nava<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>li, armorumque strepitu, vetuisset Sapientum
      <lb/>propositionem Serenissimo Senatui
      <lb/>faciendam de Persona doctissima <choice><abbr>Claris.</abbr><expan>Clarissimi</expan></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Tui Nepotis</rs>. Scire enim debes quod inpr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sentiarum Sapientes, <rs type="organisation">Senatus</rs>, tota<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c Serenissima <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Respublica</rs> de bello
      <lb/>vehementissimo contra Turcas pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cipue
      <lb/>cogitant; quibuscum non<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sentis Mensis
      <lb/>in canali <choice><orig>Jnsul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></orig><reg>Insul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></reg></choice> <rs key="place_WEI-korfua" type="place">Corfù</rs> conflictum fuisse inchoa<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tum heri vesperi (et quidem cum Turcarum damno)
      <lb/>heri vesper<unclear>e</unclear> intelleximus, nuntiumque de ulteriori pugna na<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1078864" n="2"/>
      <lb break="no"/>vali impatienter expectamus. H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c igitur in
      <lb/>causa sunt dilationis vocationis solemnis, quam
      <lb/>procul dubio accipiet brevi <choice><abbr>Doctiss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Doctissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Tuus
      <lb/>Agnatus</rs>; cui ut scriberem mihi iussit
      <lb/>ante decem dies <choice><abbr>Excell.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimus</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>D.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></abbr><expan>Dominus</expan></choice> Procurator
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-1253768439" type="person">Venerius</rs> adhoc ut omnia ad iter pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>pararet, eodem tempore mihi spondendo
      <lb/>se quam primum adhuc rogaturum fore
      <lb/>Sapientes ut <rs type="organisation">Senatui</rs> propon<unclear>ant</unclear>
      <lb/>s<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>pius laudatum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatum Tuum</rs>. Post
      <lb/>illud tempus resc<unclear>ie</unclear>nt Sapientes promisisse
      <lb/>se quamprimum facturos esse propositio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nem pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cipue aliqua die, in qua
      <lb/><rs type="organisation">Senatus</rs> adesset tranquillitas. Non est
      <lb/>igitur Vir <choice><abbr><choice><orig>Jllustriss.</orig><reg>Illustris.</reg></choice></abbr><expan>Illustrissime</expan></choice> quod amplius dubites
      <lb/>de solemni vocatione <choice><abbr>Clariss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Clarissimi</expan></choice> Tui <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nepotis</rs>,
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> quando una vice fuit decreta ab
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Ampliss.</abbr><expan>Amplissimis</expan></choice> D. D. <rs key="pers_DE-588-121843858 pers_DE-588-1178380696 pers_DE-588-1253768439" type="person">Moderatoribus</rs> infallibiliter
      <lb/>sequi debet. Sit igitur certus D. <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus
      <lb/>Tuus</rs>, seque ad docendum, iterque suscipi<unclear>en</unclear><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1078865" n="3"/>
      <lb break="no"/>dum l<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>tus disponat. <choice><orig>D<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></orig><reg>Di</reg></choice> servent, tueantur<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que <choice><abbr>Sereniss.</abbr><expan>Serenissimam</expan></choice> ac <choice><abbr>Potentiss.</abbr><expan>Potentissimam</expan></choice> <rs key="place_VER-repven" type="place">Rempublicam</rs>,
      <lb/>cuius laudem ac gloriam spero fore maxime
      <lb/>augendam in navali pugna contra infedeles <unclear>et</unclear>
      <lb/>Turcarum gentes. <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Tuus Filius</rs> excellens omni
      <lb/>genere virtutis, suavis et acris ingenii a me
      <lb/>diligitur tanquam si esset mihi Filius; etsi
      <lb/><choice><orig>D<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></orig><reg>Di</reg></choice> me servabunt incolumem, ipsi magis magis<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>que inserviam in posterum. Jpse libentissime
      <lb/>h<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>c moratur, diligitur <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> meis Amicis et Mece<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>natibus, coramque me manebit quam diu vo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>let, et quidem tanto tempore ut aliquando
      <lb/>successor sit futurus <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnati Tui</rs>. <choice><orig>Jn</orig><reg>In</reg></choice> omni<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bus iis, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ipsi demonstrandis aut solvendis
      <lb/>proposui, ita se gessit ut mihi integre sa<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tisfecerit. <choice><orig>Jpsi</orig><reg>Ipsi</reg></choice> autem quotidie aliquid agend<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>in rebus mathematicis exhibeo, et ut tempus
      <lb/>ne perdat indesinenter rogo. Ante duos dies
      <lb/>Problematis <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me propositi solutionem ag<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gressus est. Problema autem in pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>claro
      <lb/>opere <choice><abbr>Amiciss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Amicissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119112450" type="person">Hermanni</rs> <rs key="biblio_WS22BVK4" type="biblio">de Viribus et Mo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tibus Corporum Fluidorum et Solidorum</rs> solutum
<pb facs="1078866" n="4"/>
      <lb/>fuit: estque huiuscemodi. Dato tubo AB ex ma<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>teria molli seu flexili clauso in B, aper<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>toque in A ad horizontem verti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>caliter erecto et aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> aliusve
      <lb/>liquoris pleno,<figure facs="../images/figures/1078866_01.png" hand="pers_DE-588-102552517"/> determinare figuram,
      <lb/>quam sectio qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>libet horizontalis in tubo <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>
      <lb/>liquoris pressuris acquiret. Scripsit olim
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-117689548" type="person">Pitcarnius</rs> in solutione huius problematis
      <lb/>rem e<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> deduci ut inveniatur curva, cuius
      <lb/>omnes subtangentes in puncto concurrant.
      <lb/>Hanc <rs key="pers_DE-588-117689548" type="person">Pitcarnii</rs> assertionem erroris inculpat ipse
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Doctiss.</abbr><expan>Doctissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119112450" type="person">Hermannus</rs>; siquidem licet in omni curva
      <lb/>rect<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> duobus curv<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> contiguis elementis perpendi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>culares sunt, concurrant, non omnes tamen
      <lb/>curv<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> perpendiculares in uno eodemque puncto
      <lb/>concurrunt. Solutionem igitur huius Proble<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>matis etiam a Te Vir Amicissime expe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>to, quam una cum illa, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> communicabit
      <lb/><choice><abbr><choice><orig>Jngeniosiss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></orig><reg>Ingeniosiss.<hi rend="sup">us</hi></reg></choice></abbr><expan>Ingeniosissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filius Tuus</rs> publici iuris faciam
      <lb/>(Vobis tamen permittentibus) in meo opusculo,
      <lb/>quod fere ad umbilicum perductum est, de Liquo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rum Animalium Philtratione.
      <lb/>Responsum <choice><abbr><choice><orig>Jllustrissimi</orig><reg>Illustrissimi</reg></choice></abbr><expan>Illustrissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118571249" type="person">Leibnitii</rs> ad <rs type="letter">meas litte<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1078867" n="5"/>
      <lb break="no"/>ras</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Gemeint ist wohl Michelottis <ref target="https://www.gwlb.de/fileadmin/Leibniz/repositorium-des-leibniz-archivs/LAA-Transkriptionen1716-v1.pdf#page=637">Brief</ref> an Leibniz vom 29. Mai 1716. Darin erinnert Michelotti an eine etwa zwei Monate zuvor versandte Anfrage und bittet erneut um Erläuterung der «harmonia vibrationum consentientium motuumve intestinorum».</note> adhuc expecto. Celeberrimus iste <rs key="pers_DE-588-118571249" type="person">Vir</rs> dignatus
      <lb/>fuit ad me <rs type="letter"><choice><abbr>humaniss.<hi rend="sup">am</hi></abbr><expan>humanissimam</expan></choice> epistolam</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Gemeint ist Leibniz’ <ref target="https://archive.org/details/gothofrediguille02leib/page/n505/mode/1up">Brief</ref> an Michelotti vom 17. September 1715, gedruckt bei Dutens, <hi rend="i">Opera omnia</hi>, Bd. II, Teil 2, S. 89–91. Die hier angeführten Überlegungen zur Übereinstimmung der inneren Schwingungen und zum Verhältnis von Oberfläche und Körpergrösse stehen auf S. 90.</note> scribere,
      <lb/>in qua pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> reliquis assignare conatur causam prop<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ter quam Liquores Cognatis adh<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>rescant. Fatetur
      <lb/>posse esse multas, atque inter c<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>teras harmoniam
      <lb/>consentientium vibrationum, motuumve
      <lb/>intestinorum assignat. Coniuncta (inquit) si<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>milia in maius corpus minus ab externis turban<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tur cum minus habeant superficiei, et exter<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>na maxime per superficiem turbent. Roga<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bam ut h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c tanquam minus clara mihi expli<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>care ulterius, sed quum responsum nondum acce<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>perim qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>so ut super hac re tua cogitata
      <lb/>mihi communices. Si enim mechanic<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> expli<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cari posset cur liquores Cognatis adh<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>rescant,
      <lb/>liquorum Animalium percolatio etiam me<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>chanice fortasse posset enucleari. Multa ex<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>perimenta facturus sum cum Ornatissimo <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Tuo
      <lb/>Filio</rs> pro philtratione liquorum. Chartam
      <lb/>pluribus liquoribus successive imbuemus, aqua
      <lb/>puta, spiritu<choice><sic>,</sic><corr type="deleted"/></choice> vini, vino, lacte, herbarum
      <lb/>succis etc. ut videamus si semper verum sit qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice>d
      <lb/>charta uno liquore imbuta alterum liquorem
      <lb/>per suos poros transire non sinat. Spiritum
      <lb/>animalem, sive impetum faciens considera<unclear>nda</unclear>
<pb facs="1078868" n="6"/>
      <lb/>non esse scripsit simpliciter instar fluidi; magno
      <lb/>enim impetu quum sit pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ditus facil<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> elaboretur
      <lb/>nisi nexum esset. Putat ergo speciem habere
      <lb/>lanuginis elastic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> per quam impetus toto corpo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>re propagetur. Sed ego peto cur lanugo ista elas<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tica secernatur, in Cerebro, et qua ratione poros
      <lb/>nervorum angustissimos perrumpat. Vel partes
      <lb/>aut pellicul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> lanuginos<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> spiritus animales
      <lb/>nectentes aut involventes constituunt una cum ipsis
      <lb/>piritibus animalibus Humorem imperceptibilem
      <lb/>et in minimas partes divisibilem vel non. Si
      <lb/>primum ergo spiritus animales etiam in hac hypothe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>si, in arteriis pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>existentes ruere poterunt, in
      <lb/>omnia corporis secernentia, atque per poros minimos
      <lb/>effluere antequam ad Cerebrum perveniant. Si
      <lb/>secundum ergo per nervorum poros <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> nemi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ne adhuc nec microscopii ope visos ruere pote<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>runt. H<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c, et similes hypotheses de spirituum ani<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>malium natura mihi immaginari<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> videntur et nul<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>latenus ph<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>nomenis satisfacere ita ut dubi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tem an ulli dentur animales spiritus in sangui<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ne Animalium ab ipso separandi in Cerebri et Spina<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lis medull<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Glandulis. Statim ac opusculum meum absolve<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rum <choice><abbr>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>clariss.<hi rend="sup">um</hi></abbr><expan>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>clarissimum</expan></choice> opus Tuum <rs key="biblio_RTB4565Q" type="biblio">Manuari<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Nautic<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Tuo Filio</rs> faven<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>te, et adiuvante percurram.</p> <closer><salute>Plurimum interim Vale.</salute><dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Vene<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1716-07-24">24 Julii 1716.</date></dateline></closer>
